WEBVTT

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:23.270
This is bad.  If I take any 
more attacks, I'll be defeated!

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:26.810
Yusei!

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.820
Yusei will be...

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.240
I can't save Yusei?

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.510
You can.  Remember your mission.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:48.820
That's right.

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:53.260
My mission is to save Yusei!

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:16.820
Come, Delta Eagle!

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.080
They caught up.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.280
It's over, Yusei Fudo!

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:47.620
My turn!

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:13.740
Just wait, Yusei!

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:19.720
Yusei Fudo, die!

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:22.620
Die!

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:24.950
Yusei!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.290
Yusei!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.320
That's...

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.290
I equip Tech Genus Blade 
Blaster with Buster Blaster!

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:52.010
The monster equipped with Buster 
Blaster loses 500 attack points.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:59.920
But if it destroys your monster, all monsters 
on your field with the same Type are destroyed.

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:01.650
Buster Shot!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.030
You're...

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.720
Yusei, speed up!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:23.640
If you don't overcome the limits 
of speed, you can't shake them!

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.940
Get into my slipstream and keep up!

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:34.150
Yusei Fudo.

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.120
You're interfering again.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:37.240
In that case...

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:46.220
I'll be your opponent.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:03.600
Riding Duels.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:06.750
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:13.300
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:34.820
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:44.610
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:50.930
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:57.020
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:02.800
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:08.640
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:14.800
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:20.610
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:26.780
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:33.200
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:05:56.920 --> 00:06:02.760
Awakening!  Unwavering PlaceClear Mind

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:09.990
What incredible speed!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:15.840
He's catching up to our speed?

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:21.440
Yusei Fudo, you're just a bug and an eyesore.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.820
I will squash you with my Meklord Emperor.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:29.040
Meklord Emperor?  Are you the 
one controlling the Ghost army?

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.600
What if I am?

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:31.920
Why are you doing this?

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.950
You humans cannot comprehend our ideas.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:42.030
Just keep crawling like 
bugs and shudder in fear.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.230
What?

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:48.210
But Yusei, I will bury you personally.

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:49.940
Be thankful.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:53.070
This is bad!  I only have 
a few life points left.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:55.350
If I have to duel him...

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:07.760
Yusei, you must overcome your limits and 
find a way to Accel Synchro to escape danger!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.190
Accel Synchro?

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.480
Sharpen your soul.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:15.430
The D-Wheel's Moment isn't 
just an energy engine.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:21.400
The Moment uses Yusei Particles, a living 
energy that can read a human's heart.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.510
What?

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.640
Yusei Particles can read human hearts?

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:25.960
That's right.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:31.720
The Moment's inventors Professor Fudo 
and Rutger Godwin both knew the truth.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.450
A human's heart easily dies and fades away.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:40.580
That power has been used for good 
and evil since ancient times.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.930
The good heart is the Crimson Dragon!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.620
The bad heart is the evil god!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:52.370
But if your heart controls Moment, 
there's a place you can reach!

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:54.590
It's Clear Mind!

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:57.610
Yusei, you must now master it!

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:59.110
Clear Mind?

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.080
But can I do it?

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:03.930
You can do it!

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:07.820
You already know the way 
to find Accel Synchro!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.550
Feel the wind, Yusei!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.520
The wind?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:21.900
I kept driving after my battle against Ghost.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:27.320
But I still couldn't find 
a way to Accel Synchro.

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:28.500
Why is that?

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:37.080
I see!  It's because in my heart, 
I was afraid of Meklord Emperor.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.500
A place where I overcome that fear...

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:46.220
I must feel the wind!

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:58.230
Everything is vanishing, including myself.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:15.860
What's this?

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.220
Let's duel, Yusei!

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:28.890
This is what I can only see inside speed!

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:31.860
This is Clear Mind!

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:43.780
What?

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.060
Yusei!

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:47.750
He found it!

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:50.570
No way!  Where did he go?

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:54.800
Yusei is heading towards his new potential.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:56.650
I'll be your opponent!

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.220
You're from before...

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:09.080
What did you do in your duel against Yusei?

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.710
Are you afraid of me?

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:12.640
You must be.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:16.610
I was sent to this world 
in order to defeat you!

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:17.860
What?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:24.680
In order to stop your plans in this 
world, I'll show you my Accel Synchro!

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.300
What?

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.740
I thought you died then.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:45.630
Who are you?

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.790
How do you know about us?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.070
I don't need to say because 
I'm going to defeat you.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.200
I like that answer.

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:54.780
Then I'll force you to tell me!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:56.490
Duel!

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:20.400
Where am I?

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:39.590
Impossible!  That's not our stone tablet!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.560
Why does he get a stone tablet?

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:46.760
Can Yusei Fudo also hear god's voice?

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:50.730
Impossible!  Does that 
mean he's just like us?

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.500
No way!

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:58.230
This is...

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.980
This showed me the path of light.

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.200
You!

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.240
Who are you?

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:38.310
Yusei, you acquired new potential.

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.020
What's this?

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:47.070
That is Clear Mind.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.490
That card makes Accel Synchro possible.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:50.720
This?

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:54.770
You have the right to receive it.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:58.120
All possibilities are equal.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:12:59.850
You know who I am?

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:05.320
Travel the path that you believe is correct.

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:08.920
If you do, you will eventually...

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:10.250
Wait!

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:35.100
I believe the correct 
path is to save the city!

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:42.600
I'll go first!

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:43.570
Fine!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:44.570
My turn!

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.880
I summon Wise Core in defense position.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:56.290
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:58.920
A monster with 0 defense points.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:00.490
He wants me to attack.

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:06.460
When an effect destroys Wise Core, it 
can instantly bring out Meklord Emperor.

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:13.000
I see.  He will destroy his own 
Wise Core with his set card.

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:14.470
My turn!

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:18.660
I Special Summon Tech Genus Striker!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:27.260
I can Special Summon Tech 
Genus Striker from my hand

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.560
when monsters are only on 
your side of the field.

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.950
Then I Special Summon Tech Genus Warwolf.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:45.700
I can Special Summon it from my hand when I 
Special Summon a Level 4-or-below monster.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:51.710
Level 2 Tech Genus Striker tunes 
Level 3 Tech Genus Warwolf!

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:56.440
Synchro flight control!  
Limiter removal level five!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.760
Booster injection 120%!

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:01.000
Revise recovery network range!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:01.880
All clear!

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:04.710
Go, Synchro Summon!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:08.030
C'mon, Tech Genus Power Gladiator!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.280
It's a Synchro Summon.

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:12.330
What an eyesore.

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:16.010
Then I summon Tech Genus Rush Rhino.

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:23.550
I'll face Meklord Emperor's power!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:27.690
Tech Genus Power Gladiator attacks Wise Core!

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:32.520
I activate my trap Twin Vortex.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:40.310
When you attack, one monster on my field and 
one monster on your field are destroyed.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:46.930
That card utilizes both countering 
and Wise Core's effect.

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:49.880
I activate Power Gladiator's effect!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:53.870
When this card is destroyed, I draw one card!

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:56.920
I activate Wise Core's effect.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:16:01.900
When Wise Core is destroyed, I destroy 
all my monsters to Special Summon...

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.810
...Meklord Emperor Wisel...

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:06.250
...Wisel Top...

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.450
...Wisel Attack...

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.190
...Wisel Guard...

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:12.820
...and Wisel Carrier.

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:16.810
Combine, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:24.100
Meklord Emperor Wisel gains attack 
points from its other parts!

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:38.480
Meklord Emperor Wisel has appeared!

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:40.850
It has 2500 attack points.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:44.070
Tech Genus Rush Rhino doesn't have 
enough attack points to defeat it.

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:47.460
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:49.290
My turn!

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:54.990
Turn his monster into dust, 
Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:13.610
But Tech Genus Rush Rhino's 
effect now activates!

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:19.780
When this card is destroyed, I can add one 
card with the same name from my deck to my hand!

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:24.330
Do you seriously think that you 
can defeat my Meklord Emperor?

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:27.060
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:29.590
My turn!

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:34.410
I summon Tech Genus Cyber Magician.

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:42.760
I activate Tech Genus 
Cyber Magician's effect.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:48.540
When I use it to Synchro Summon, I can 
substitute the required monsters with those in my hand!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:54.520
Level 1 Tech Genus Cyber Magician 
tunes Level 4 Tech Genus Rush Rhino!

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:56.380
Limiter removal level five!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.880
Booster launch OK!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.910
Inclination OK!

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.260
Ground support all clear!

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.230
Go, Synchro Summon!

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:07.340
C'mon, Tech Genus Wonder Magician!

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:11.600
I activate the trap Double Type Rescue!

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:16.360
When I have two Types and fewer monsters 
on my field than you, I can Special Summon

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.510
a monster from my graveyard!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.800
I only have Tech Genus Wonder 
Magician on my field.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:28.740
But Tech Genus Wonder Magician counts as 
both Machine-Type and Spellcaster-Type!

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:31.050
Two Types?

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:35.640
Therefore, Double Type 
Rescue's effect activates!

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:39.880
I resurrect Tech Genus Power Gladiator!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.200
Two Synchro Monsters...

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:55.610
I now know the identity 
of your Accel Synchro!

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:57.790
I-

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:12.430
That's cheating!

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:14.290
You're interfering with my Accel Synchro!

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:17.200
We're in the middle of battle royal mode.

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:18.760
My turn!

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:22.730
Go, Ally Salvo!

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:34.610
When a Light Attribute monster 
destroys Ally Salvo in battle,

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.020
two cards on the field are destroyed.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:37.980
What?

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:44.590
What's wrong?  You don't 
have any strategies left?

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:48.930
Die!

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:50.660
Who is it?

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:57.870
Yusei!

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:00.070
You've returned, Yusei Fudo!

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:03.690
Go, Yusei!

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:05.280
I'll take care of the minions!

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:11.720
I'm your opponent!

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:15.950
Good timing!  I'll defeat you both together!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:16.920
Here I go!

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.250
Stop, Placido.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:23.230
Yusei Fudo acquired a new 
power.  You must stop.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.570
What do you mean?

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:28.530
I'm super surprised!  He also 
received a divine message from god!

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:29.550
What?

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:30.940
Return, Placido.

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:33.660
He's not someone you can battle safely!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.740
You think I'm going to lose against him?

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:37.010
Placido!

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:43.580
It doesn't matter what power he acquired!

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.640
I'll show you my true power!

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:04.570
What are you planning to do?

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:33.440
What?

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:36.330
So that's his true form.

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:39.990
Yusei Fudo, you won't escape this time!

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:40.800
Let's duel!

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:56.890
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:56.890 --> 00:22:04.780
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:21.630
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:27.240
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:32.840
You do this over and over

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:38.450
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.450 --> 00:22:44.300
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:51.400
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:57.370
Close to you   If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:02.970
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:02.970 --> 00:23:08.710
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:08.710 --> 00:23:16.890
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
